<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#contrast_between_activity_and_rest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image juxtaposes the visual of rest and intimacy with the text 'after a long day of mudding,' implying a contrast between physical labor and relaxation. This contrast creates a humorous and relatable tone, suggesting that after a day of hard work, rest is highly desired."@en .
