<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#projectedOnto> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TextualMaterial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Textual Material includes: captions, text overlays, speech bubbles, written words, phrases, sentences, and any visible text."@en .
