<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#overallintent_instance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_1; overall-intent-description: The scene depicts two nude individuals sleeping intimately in a bed with white linens, suggesting a private, restful moment. The text overlay reads 'when you want to nap after a long day of mudding,' which juxtaposes the image of rest with the implied physical labor of 'mudding.' There is no toxicity present in this meme. The intent is humorous and relatable, using the visual of relaxed intimacy to contrast with the implied gritty, physical activity of mudding, creating a lighthearted and affectionate tone. The meme does not target any specific group based on protected characteristics, nor does it contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic content. The overall intent is to evoke humor through the contrast between the image of rest and the text's implication of hard work, without any harmful or offensive elements."@en .
