<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#physical_exertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical exertion refers to the use of physical strength or energy, often involving strenuous activity. The background knowledge required to understand the meme is that 'mudding' is a physically demanding activity, which contrasts with the restful scene depicted in the image. This contrast is central to the meme's humor and relatability."@en .
