<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#intimate_posture> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The individuals are in an intimate posture, with one person curled up on top of the other, partially covering their face. This posture suggests closeness, comfort, and rest, reinforcing the theme of relaxation and intimacy."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#SemioticProjection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Semiotic Projection is about the projection of the User seeing the meme onto a certain part of the meme. The projection could be onto some VisualMaterial or some TextualMaterial or some Scene."@en .
