<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#contentment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The intimate, restful posture of the two individuals on the bed, combined with the soft natural lighting and rumpled white linens, conveys a sense of deep satisfaction and peaceful relaxation. The scene suggests they are comfortable, safe, and at ease with each other, evoking a feeling of contentment after physical exertion."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#causallyRelatedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#consilientWith> .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#horizontallyAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates left/right spatial adjacency between dimension instances in memes"@en .
_:n04d72e1a0fc345aa8e9e64a712e4da96b46 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#physical_exertion> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#extractionTimestamp> "2025-12-12T02:24:12.122201" .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#bed> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#extractionTimestamp> "2025-12-12T02:24:12.122201" .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#restful_environment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A restful environment is one that promotes relaxation, comfort, and tranquility. In the context of the meme, the setting of a bed with white linens and natural sunlight is interpreted as a restful environment, which contrasts with the implied gritty, physical nature of 'mudding'. The background knowledge required to understand the meme is that such environments are culturally associated with rest, sleep, and personal comfort, which enhances the humor of the contrast."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#descriptivelyAlignedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates one dimension describing the other, usually text literally describing visual content in memes"@en .
