<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#two_nude_individuals> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Two individuals are lying together on a bed, both nude. One person is positioned on their back with their head resting on a pillow, while the other is curled up on top of them, partially covering their face. Their bodies are in close physical contact, suggesting intimacy or rest. The scene is set in a private, restful environment with white linens."@en .
