<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#bed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A bed with white sheets and pillows, appearing rumpled and slightly disheveled, indicating recent use or relaxation. The bed occupies the majority of the frame, serving as the primary setting for the scene."@en .
