<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#tattoo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A small tattoo is visible on the lower back of the person lying on their back, near the hip. The tattoo is faint and appears to be a simple design, adding a subtle detail to the individual's physical appearance."@en .
