<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#sunlight> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Natural sunlight is streaming into the room, casting soft shadows and highlighting the contours of the individuals' bodies. The lighting suggests a daytime setting, possibly morning or afternoon, contributing to the serene and peaceful atmosphere."@en .
