<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#relatable_humor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relatable humor is a type of humor that resonates with a broad audience because it reflects common experiences or situations. The background knowledge required to understand the meme is that the juxtaposition of 'mudding' (a physically demanding activity) with 'nap' (a desired state of rest) is a relatable scenario for many people who have experienced physical exhaustion and the desire for rest. This relatability is key to the meme's effectiveness."@en .
