<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01423#nap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A nap is a short period of sleep, typically taken during the day, often for rest or recovery. The term is commonly used to describe a brief, informal sleep break, especially after a long day of work or activity. The background knowledge required to understand the meme is that 'nap' implies a desired state of rest and relaxation, which contrasts with the implied physical exertion of 'mudding'."@en .
